# MBOX.SCR - INVTEST's sessions against INVSERV on fresh data through
# the mailbox E:\, a share of the server's MBOX, and on COM1 (run by
# wgagate.sh, MBOXEND.SCR after it): each mailbox post is one request
# file, its station the file's name.  RIMBOX, an administrator's
# station, sets the password that the first LOGIN must change, adds an
# item and finds itself listed as a mailbox session; RIREAD, which
# SRV.CFG names read-only, is capped at level 1 by its file name alone,
# the same user and password notwithstanding; a session on COM1 lists
# the item.

@MBOX 1 RIMBOX E:\
>& HELLO RIMBOX
>& LOGIN ADMIN admin
>& PASSWD admin Wga2gate
>& ITEM ADD CATEGORY=DRV MFR=Tandon MODEL=TM100-2 QTY=2
>& ADMIN CLIENTS
>& BYE
@POST 1
@WAIT 1
< +OK
@WAIT 1
< +OK LEVEL=3 MUSTCHG=1
@WAIT 1
< +OK
@WAIT 1
< +OK ID=1
@WAIT 1
< +DATA
< F SLOT TYPE STATION USER LEVEL STATE IDLE SELF
<* R * MBOX RIMBOX ADMIN 3 3 * 1
< .
@WAIT 1
< +OK

@MBOX 2 RIREAD E:\
>& HELLO RIREAD
>& LOGIN ADMIN Wga2gate
>& ITEM SET 1 QTY=3
>& ITEM LIST CAT=DRV
>& BYE
@POST 2
@WAIT 2
< +OK
@WAIT 2
< +OK LEVEL=1 NAME="System Administrator"
@WAIT 2
< -ERR 203 permission denied
@WAIT 2
< +DATA
< F ITEM_ID CATEGORY MFR MODEL WORKS QTY AVAIL LOC_ID LOC_NAME STATUS
< R 1 DRV Tandon TM100-2 ? 2 Y 0 "" A
< .
@WAIT 2
< +OK

@COM 3 COM1
> HELLO RISER
< +OK
> LOGIN ADMIN Wga2gate
< +OK LEVEL=3 NAME="System Administrator"
> ADMIN CLIENTS
< +DATA
< F SLOT TYPE STATION USER LEVEL STATE IDLE SELF
<* R * COM1 RISER ADMIN 3 3 * 1
< .
> ITEM LIST CAT=DRV
< +DATA
< F ITEM_ID CATEGORY MFR MODEL WORKS QTY AVAIL LOC_ID LOC_NAME STATUS
< R 1 DRV Tandon TM100-2 ? 2 Y 0 "" A
< .
> BYE
< +OK
